  "justification": "Each AniDB episode is one tri. film, and TVDB 290290 lists each film as a season of chapters: 1 Reunion = S1E1-4 Reunion (1)-(4), 2 Determination = S2E1-4, 3 Confession = S3E1-5, 4 Loss = S4E1-4, 5 Coexistence = S5E1-4, 6 Bokura no Mirai = S6E1-5 Our Future (1)-(5), with each film's dates. The default sent film k to season 1 episode k. The special Digimon Special Drama has no TVDB episode; its default was season 0 episode 1, the 2020 film (node 14240). TMDB tv 118687 no longer exists; TMDB lists the films as six movies, so the TV values go.",
